@startuml admin-auth
!include admin-common.puml
title Authentification administrateur

== Authentification admin ==
Admin -> Frontend: Connexion admin
Frontend -> API: POST /api/auth/login
note right
Body: {email, password, role: ADMIN}
end note
API -> Auth: validateAdminLogin(credentials)
Auth -> DB: SELECT user WHERE email=? AND role=ADMIN
DB --> Auth: admin user data
Auth -> SecuritySvc: validateAdminAccess(user)
SecuritySvc -> SecuritySvc: Check IP whitelist, MFA, etc.
SecuritySvc --> Auth: access validated
Auth -> AuditSvc: logAdminLogin(userId, ip, userAgent)
AuditSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs (action: admin_login)
Auth --> API: admin authenticated
API --> Frontend: admin session + permissions
Frontend --> Admin: Accès au panneau d'administration

@enduml